		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115011</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="743" height="734" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-1-List.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Canada Walmart LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Week 1 List" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-1-List.jpg 743w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-1-List-300x296.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 743px) 100vw, 743px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>Wal-Mart Canada Online LEGO Black Friday Deals Week 1 Offers have just started and are now live! Sale</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-wal-mart-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-week-1-now-live-up-to-40-off-selected-sets-over-30-to-choose-from/">[Canada] Wal-Mart LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Week 1 Now Live: Up to 40% off Selected Sets (Over 30 to Choose From)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> LEGO Black Friday Deals Week 1 Offers have just started and are now live! Sale starts online from Wednesday, November 18, 2026 at 9pm EST and ends online on Wednesday, November 25, 2026 at 8:59pm EST.</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fshop%2Fblack-friday%2F1539158293147%3Ffacet%3Dbrand%253ALEGO%26icid%3Ddeals_page_gifts_and_seasonal_bf_lp_lego_hsk_206616_JHCKRP1RNX" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115020 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-1-List.jpg" alt="" width="743" height="734" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-1-List.jpg 743w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-1-List-300x296.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 743px) 100vw, 743px" /></a></p>
<p>There are over <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fshop%2Fblack-friday%2F1539158293147%3Ffacet%3Dbrand%253ALEGO%26icid%3Ddeals_page_gifts_and_seasonal_bf_lp_lego_hsk_206616_JHCKRP1RNX" target="_blank" rel="noopener">30 LEGO toys discounted for Black Friday 2026 Week 1</a>. My top pick would probably be the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fip%2FLEGO-Star-Wars-327th-Corps-Clone-Troopers-Battle-Pack-Building-Toy-Pretend-Play-Set-Boys-Girls-Ages-7-Collectible-Model-Kit-Kids-Room-Decor-Gift-Idea%2F38LKRB25V78Y%3FclassType%3DREGULAR%26athbdg%3DL1800" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars 327th Star Corps Clone Troopers Battle Pack 75431</a> at<strong> $29.86</strong> (reg.$49.99) which is practically 40% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fip%2FLEGO-Star-Wars-327th-Corps-Clone-Troopers-Battle-Pack-Building-Toy-Pretend-Play-Set-Boys-Girls-Ages-7-Collectible-Model-Kit-Kids-Room-Decor-Gift-Idea%2F38LKRB25V78Y%3FclassType%3DREGULAR%26athbdg%3DL1800" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-98127 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75431-327th-Star-Corps-Clone-Troopers-Battle-Pack-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="843" height="842" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75431-327th-Star-Corps-Clone-Troopers-Battle-Pack-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 843w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75431-327th-Star-Corps-Clone-Troopers-Battle-Pack-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75431-327th-Star-Corps-Clone-Troopers-Battle-Pack-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75431-327th-Star-Corps-Clone-Troopers-Battle-Pack-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x767.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 843px) 100vw, 843px" /></a></p>
<p>Note that <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada</a> did not list the regular price for a few of the sets. Check <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> for official regular retail prices. Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fshop%2Fblack-friday%2F1539158293147%3Ffacet%3Dbrand%253ALEGO%26icid%3Ddeals_page_gifts_and_seasonal_bf_lp_lego_hsk_206616_JHCKRP1RNX" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115021 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List.jpg" alt="" width="491" height="746" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List.jpg 491w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Walmart-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List-197x300.jpg 197w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 491px) 100vw, 491px" /></a></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada by subscribing to our email list.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that <span style="font-weight: 400;">prefer mobile device real time push notifications </span> for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>*<strong>More great LEGO sales buys can be found on the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fsearch%3Fq%3Dlego%26facet%3Dfacet_ss_BestSellers%253ABestSellers%257C%257Cretailer_type%253AWalmart%26affinityOverride%3Ddefault" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Bestsellers List</a>. </strong>Make sure to filter the seller to Wal-Mart Canada (and not third party sellers) and choose Best Selling Items.</p>
<p>We also have a <strong><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="843" height="673" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 843px) 100vw, 843px" /></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. <em>Please ensure to accept the merchant’s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) and disable browser extensions (if there are any) so that the affiliate link works. </em>Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-wal-mart-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-week-1-now-live-up-to-40-off-selected-sets-over-30-to-choose-from/">[Canada] Wal-Mart LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Week 1 Now Live: Up to 40% off Selected Sets (Over 30 to Choose From)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
