		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:51:17 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks Sales]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115013</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Pokemon 72168 Rayquaza Summer August 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Macy&#8217;s US Online has started their round 2 LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026! The sale started a few</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-macys-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-round-2-now-live-20-40-off-many-sets/">[US] Macy&#8217;s LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Round 2 Now Live: 20-40% off Many Sets</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fsearch%3Fkeyword%3Dlego" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Macy&#8217;s US Online</a> has started their round 2 LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026! The sale started a few days ago but they have <a href="https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fbrands%2Flego%2FSpecial_offers%2FBlack%2520Friday%2520Deal%257CSales%2520%2526%2520Discounts%3Fid%3D200756%26cm_kws%3Dlego" target="_blank" rel="noopener">now added new items to the sales list</a>. Most items are 20% off while there are a few that are 40% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fbrands%2Flego%2FSpecial_offers%2FBlack%2520Friday%2520Deal%257CSales%2520%2526%2520Discounts%3Fid%3D200756%26cm_kws%3Dlego" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115014 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Round-2-List.jpg" alt="" width="631" height="790" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Round-2-List.jpg 631w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Round-2-List-240x300.jpg 240w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 631px) 100vw, 631px" /></a></p>
<p>My recommended pick would be the <a href="https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-one-piece-battle-at-drum-castle-75645-1038-piece-building-set-ages-9%3FID%3D26415632" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO ONE PIECE Battle at Drum Castle 75645</a> at <strong>$87.99</strong> (reg.$109.99) which works out to be 20% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-one-piece-battle-at-drum-castle-75645-1038-piece-building-set-ages-9%3FID%3D26415632" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-106624 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-one-piece-battle-at-drum-castle-75645-1038-piece-building-set-ages-9%3FID%3D26415632" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-106630 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="764" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 764w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-191x300.png 191w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75645-Battle-at-Drum-Castle-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-652x1024.png 652w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 764px) 100vw, 764px" /></a></p>
<p>There&#8217;s also the <a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-pokemon-rayquaza-posable-display-building-set-72168-1083-piece-ages-18%3FID%3D26415627" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Pokémon Rayquaza Decor 72168</a> on sale for<strong> $90.99</strong> (reg.$129.99). Savings work out to be 30% off which is a pretty decent discount for an 18+ Adults Welcome set.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-pokemon-rayquaza-posable-display-building-set-72168-1083-piece-ages-18%3FID%3D26415627" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-110612 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-pokemon-rayquaza-posable-display-building-set-72168-1083-piece-ages-18%3FID%3D26415627" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-110628 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="774" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 774w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-194x300.png 194w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-660x1024.png 660w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72168-Rayquaza-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x1191.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 774px) 100vw, 774px" /></a></p>
<p>The <a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-pokemon-iconic-trainer-moments-poke-ball-72154-2386-piece-building-set-ages-18%3FID%3D26415650" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Pokémon Iconic Trainer Moments Poké Ball 72154</a> is on sale for <strong>$224.99</strong> (reg.$299.99). Savings work out to be 25% off. I like to mention that this set is also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/11-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-november-18-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">on sale at Amazon as well but its only 20% off</a>. As such, I would recommend purchasing it at Macy&#8217;s instead as its cheaper at 25% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-pokemon-iconic-trainer-moments-poke-ball-72154-2386-piece-building-set-ages-18%3FID%3D26415650" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-110590 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-pokemon-iconic-trainer-moments-poke-ball-72154-2386-piece-building-set-ages-18%3FID%3D26415650" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-110608 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="808" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 808w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-202x300.png 202w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-689x1024.png 689w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x1141.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 808px) 100vw, 808px" /></a></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="730" height="583" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 730px) 100vw, 730px" /></p>
