					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO Pokemon 72154 Iconic Trainer Moments Poké Ball October 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Good Late Afternoon Everyone. Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/11-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-november-18-2026/">11 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 18, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Late Afternoon Everyone. <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-110603 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deal would probably be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-A-2026-72154/dp/B0G2SZ6DS8?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=b8b7d814cbbab30bc5af1fe4389844cc&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Pokémon Iconic Trainer Moments Poké Ball 72154</a> at 20% off <strong>$239.99</strong> (reg.$299.99). It has some of the first ever LEGO Pokemon Minifigure Characters. Another great buy would be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Disney-Princess-43293/dp/B0G2T2742B?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=4faf7191e7629e31d13707e43ff20a75&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Disney Moana Kakamora 43293</a> at 30% off for <strong>$27.99</strong> (reg.$39.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-108001 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43293-Kakamora-June-2026-Lifestyle-5.jpg" alt="" width="1275" height="850" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43293-Kakamora-June-2026-Lifestyle-5.jpg 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43293-Kakamora-June-2026-Lifestyle-5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43293-Kakamora-June-2026-Lifestyle-5-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43293-Kakamora-June-2026-Lifestyle-5-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43293-Kakamora-June-2026-Lifestyle-5-1536x1024.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1275px) 100vw, 1275px" /></p>
<p>Below are 11 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 18, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<h3>11 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 18, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>43% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-DUPLO-Bluey-Toddler-Preschool/dp/B0DRW4WWVC?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=044fa0394cc3beb2ff5c4ba186f77497&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO DUPLO Bluey: Bluey’s Family House with Memory Game 10459</a><strong> $40</strong> (reg.$69.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Disney-Sallys-Flowerpot-Building/dp/B0FMYTSKS3?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d8227f005f6429718ab161dca28560f5&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Disney Sally’s Flowerpot 43288</a> <strong>$39.96</strong> (reg.$49.99)</li>
</ul>
