<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-insiders-weekend-november-2026-new-reward-items-including-retro-m-tron-explorer-mini-santas-workshop-points-sweepstake-more/">LEGO Insiders Weekend November 2026: New Reward Items Including Retro M-Tron Explorer, Mini Santa&#8217;s Workshop, Points Sweepstake &#038; More</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114905 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="1317" height="457" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo.jpg 1317w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-300x104.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-1024x355.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-768x266.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1317px) 100vw, 1317px" /></p>
<p>LEGO Insiders Weekend November 2026 is coming soon at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Insiders is a free rewards program that anyone can join. Yesterday, we <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-insiders-weekend-promotions-revealed-double-points-gwp-gift-with-purchases-sale-november-21-22-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">revealed in our article</a> what the GWP Gift with Purchases as well as what promotions will be available.</p>
<p>Today, new LEGO Insiders Rewards sets for Insiders Weekend have been revealed. These exclusive sets will be available for redemption at the Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) starting on Friday, November 20, 2026. Note that this is a day earlier before the actual Insiders Weekend 2026 promotions start (November 21-22, 2026).</p>
<p>In my honest opinion, I think the new LEGO Retro M-Tron Explorer and LEGO Mini Santa&#8217;s Workshop are all at &#8220;regular rewards redemption price&#8221;. A lot of the other rewards though I think they are discounted like the Fantasy Adventure Ride set for 600 points.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114969 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1-Million-Insiders-Reward-Points-LEGO-Sweepstake-Banner-Logo.webp" alt="" width="708" height="438" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1-Million-Insiders-Reward-Points-LEGO-Sweepstake-Banner-Logo.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1-Million-Insiders-Reward-Points-LEGO-Sweepstake-Banner-Logo-300x186.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1-Million-Insiders-Reward-Points-LEGO-Sweepstake-Banner-Logo-1024x633.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1-Million-Insiders-Reward-Points-LEGO-Sweepstake-Banner-Logo-768x475.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 708px) 100vw, 708px" /></p>
<p>I also like to mention starting November 20, 2026, you can enter a free sweepstake (cost 0 points) at the Insider Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) where you can potentially win 1 million Insiders Reward Points.</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when the Insiders Weekend 2026 goes live!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Insiders Rewards Center Exclusive Sets Highlights</span></h3>
<h3>LEGO Retro M-Tron Explorer &#8211; Insiders Reward Set</h3>
<p>LEGO 6671142 Retro M-Tron Explorer November 2026 will be available for redemption at 2400 Insiders Reward Points at the Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114965 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-6671142-Retro-M-Tron-Explorer-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="801" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-6671142-Retro-M-Tron-Explorer-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-6671142-Retro-M-Tron-Explorer-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-6671142-Retro-M-Tron-Explorer-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-1024x684.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-6671142-Retro-M-Tron-Explorer-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-768x513.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<h3>LEGO Mini Santa&#8217;s Workshop &#8211; Insiders Reward Set</h3>
<p>New to the Insiders Rewards Center is the LEGO Mini Santa&#8217;s Workshop November 2026. This set will be available for redemption at 2400 Insiders Reward Points at the Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114963 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Mini-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Reward-Set-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend.webp" alt="" width="1135" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Mini-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Reward-Set-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend.webp 1135w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Mini-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Reward-Set-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-284x300.webp 284w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Mini-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Reward-Set-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-969x1024.webp 969w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Mini-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Reward-Set-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-768x812.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Mini-Santas-Workshop-Insiders-Reward-Set-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-1024x1083.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1135px) 100vw, 1135px" /></p>
<h3>LEGO 5007489 Fantasy Adventure Ride &#8211; Insiders Rewards Set</h3>
<p>LEGO Insiders Rewards Center 5007489 Fantasy Adventure Ride Set will be available for redemption at 600 Insiders Reward Points at the Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Its pretty good value for points redemption considering the size of the set. This set was available several years ago as part of Bricktober so its nice to see this set return.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114967 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5007489Fantasy-Adventure-Ride-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="900" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5007489Fantasy-Adventure-Ride-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5007489Fantasy-Adventure-Ride-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-300x225.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5007489Fantasy-Adventure-Ride-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5007489Fantasy-Adventure-Ride-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-768x576.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<h3>LEGO 5008074 Grey Castle Set &#8211; Insiders Rewards Set</h3>
<p>LEGO 5008074 Grey Castle Set 6487473 will be available for redemption at 600 Insiders Reward Points at the Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). With 112 pieces, I think 600 points is not bad value. But I think the previous Fantasy Adventure Ride is still better value at 600 points.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114966 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008074-Grey-Castle-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="921" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008074-Grey-Castle-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008074-Grey-Castle-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box-300x230.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008074-Grey-Castle-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box-1024x786.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008074-Grey-Castle-Set-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box-768x589.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<h3>LEGO 5008945 Treasure Chest 6535734 &#8211; Insiders Rewards Set</h3>
<p>LEGO 5008945 Treasure Chest 6535734 contains 154 pieces and will be available for 600 Insiders Reward Points at the Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114968 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008945-Treasure-Chest-6535734-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="892" height="729" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008945-Treasure-Chest-6535734-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008945-Treasure-Chest-6535734-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box-300x245.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008945-Treasure-Chest-6535734-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box-1024x837.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-5008945-Treasure-Chest-6535734-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Front-Box-768x628.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 892px) 100vw, 892px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Botanicals 5009934 Dragonfly Garden &#8211; Insiders Reward Set</span></h3>
<p>LEGO Botanicals 5009934 Dragonfly Garden Reward will be available for 1000 reward points redemption at the Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104027 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-6615075-Botanicals-Dragonfly-Garden-January-2026-Insiders-Reward-Promo-Gift-Box-Set.jpg" alt="" width="1034" height="604" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-6615075-Botanicals-Dragonfly-Garden-January-2026-Insiders-Reward-Promo-Gift-Box-Set.jpg 1034w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-6615075-Botanicals-Dragonfly-Garden-January-2026-Insiders-Reward-Promo-Gift-Box-Set-300x175.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-6615075-Botanicals-Dragonfly-Garden-January-2026-Insiders-Reward-Promo-Gift-Box-Set-1024x598.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-6615075-Botanicals-Dragonfly-Garden-January-2026-Insiders-Reward-Promo-Gift-Box-Set-768x449.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1034px) 100vw, 1034px" /></p>
<p>Visit the LEGO Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) to see more upcoming rewards and sets available for redemption during Insiders Weekend 2026! You must be logged in to your rewards account to see them.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114970 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Rewards-List.jpg" alt="" width="687" height="826" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Rewards-List.jpg 687w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Rewards-Center-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-2026-Rewards-List-250x300.jpg 250w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 687px) 100vw, 687px" /></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when the Insiders Weekend 2026 goes live!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Insiders Weekend November 2026 Promotions Summary</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026: </strong>Double Insiders Reward Points on LEGO purchases</li>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026:</strong> Free LEGO 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP gift set when you spend over $170 USD / $220 CAD / £155 GBP / $275 AUD</li>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026:</strong> Free LEGO 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP gift set when you spend over $250 USD / $325 CAD / £225 GBP / $410 AUD</li>
<li><strong>November 21-26, 2026:</strong> 4x Insiders Reward Points on selected LEGO items</li>
<li><strong>November 21-26, 2026:</strong> Insiders Member Sale Price &amp; Discount on selected sets</li>
<li><strong>Starting November 20, 2026:</strong> New Insiders Rewards Available for Redemption &amp; FREE Sweepstake to potentially win 1 million Insiders Reward Points</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114904 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds.jpg" alt="" width="1316" height="548" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds.jpg 1316w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds-300x125.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds-1024x426.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds-768x320.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1316px) 100vw, 1316px" /></p>
