					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO One Piece 75646 Garp&#039;s Marine Battleship Summer August 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Good Evening Everyone. Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/24-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-17-2026/">24 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, November 17, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Evening Everyone. <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-106617 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="829" height="829" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75646-Garps-Marine-Battleship-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 829px) 100vw, 829px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deals include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-A-2026-72160/dp/B0G2T4ZZ5T?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=7feca1f49000750492a7120c65cdb70c&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Pokémon Arcanine 72160</a> at 20% off for <strong>$87.99</strong> (reg.$109.99), <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-ONE-PIECE-75646/dp/B0G2SZYPWJ?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=48fff77d477efc741d1cac42493b8da8&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO ONE PIECE Garp&#8217;s Marine Battleship 75646</a> at 20% off for <strong>$143.99</strong> (reg.$179.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-Brunis-Building/dp/B0FMS6NP4Q?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d044d4e37555a5eeaac4668594793b45&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Disney Frozen Olaf and Bruni’s Picnic Fun 43287</a> at 44% off for <strong>$27.99</strong> (reg.$49.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-110629 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72160-Arcanine-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72160-Arcanine-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72160-Arcanine-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72160-Arcanine-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72160-Arcanine-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72160-Arcanine-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103132 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43287-Olaf-and-Brunis-Picnic-Fun-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="882" height="849" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43287-Olaf-and-Brunis-Picnic-Fun-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 882w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43287-Olaf-and-Brunis-Picnic-Fun-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x289.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43287-Olaf-and-Brunis-Picnic-Fun-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x739.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 882px) 100vw, 882px" /></p>
<p>Below are 24 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 17, 2026.  Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>24 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 17, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Special-2026-43029/dp/B0G2T3M4KR?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d36858929e4d61b923084e7afdbd9958&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Editions Olivia Rodrigo&#8217;s Concert Moon 43029</a> <strong>$39.99</strong> (reg.$49.99)</li>
