<p>1. <span id="productTitle" class="a-size-medium product-title-word-break">LEGO Star Wars Darth Vader Bust 75439 &#8211; 20</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">% off (Regular $49.99, on sale for $39.98)</span></p>
<ul>
